WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.500
Welcome to a live demonstration of QuoraBot Pro.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.500
An advanced desktop automation engine engineered in Python with native Windows APIs.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.500
Through this intuitive interface, campaigns are driven directly via live Google Sheets.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.500
Targeting custom keywords and high-intent queries with zero manual intervention.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Once launched, the engine manages an isolated Chrome profile with realistic human-cursor physics.

6
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.000
Using smooth Bezier curves and inertial wheel scrolling, it effortlessly bypasses bot detection.

7
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:38.500
It analyzes each recommended answer and identifies non-target discussions.

8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.200
Irrelevant responses are automatically downvoted to suppress low-value visibility.

9
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
To capture trending search volume, QuoraBot Pro executes an automated section transition.

10
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:57.000
Notice the cursor smoothly navigating to the sort dropdown.

11
00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:02.200
Switching the feed from 'Recommended' to 'Recent' to engage fresh discussions immediately.

12
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.500
The engine features intelligent error recovery.

13
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:17.000
If a network stall occurs, it performs an automatic reload with exponential backoff.

14
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:23.000
Staged inertial scrolling then injects fresh answers until the target threshold of 50 questions is reached.

15
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.500
Finally, the bot performs active algorithmic suppression.

16
00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:42.000
For irrelevant answers, it triggers the dismiss workflow, selecting 'Unrelated to this page'.

17
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:48.800
Actively deprioritizing competitor presence while streaming real-time diagnostic logs.

18
00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:54.500
This is scalable, undetectable organic growth automation.

